1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:01,925
USA 1, Belgium 4.

2
00:00:01,925 --> 00:00:06,025
3 goals of daylight by the
final whistle.

3
00:00:06,025 --> 00:00:08,027
Start with the baseline.

4
00:00:08,027 --> 00:00:11,781
Neither side could claim the
baseline counts.

5
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:13,783
Pass share was 56 to 44.

6
00:00:13,783 --> 00:00:17,040
Ketelaere opened it in the 8th minute.

7
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:23,125
5 goals later it finished 1-4, Lukaku
having the final say in the 92nd.

8
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:26,314
USA took 7 shots and put 2 on target.

9
00:00:26,314 --> 00:00:30,020
Belgium took 15 and hit the
target 7 times.

10
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:35,967
Blocked efforts are marked separately,
because a block is not a save.

11
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:41,624
This is attacking pressure in five minute
blocks, built from final-third passes,

12
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:43,674
box entries, shots and goals.

13
00:00:43,674 --> 00:00:48,058
The biggest surge belongs to Belgium
in the 5-9 minute window.

14
00:00:48,058 --> 00:00:49,843
Belgium win it 1-4.

15
00:00:49,843 --> 00:00:56,233
7 shots on target, 4 big chances, and a
result that matches the map.
